<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi{{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
I’m sorry to hear about the inflight entertainment difficulties you experienced during your recent flight to {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong>Things don’t always go to plan</strong><br />
<br />
We understand that experiencing malfunctioning entertainment during your flight can be very frustrating.<br />
<br />
Our cabin crew do their best to explore all avenues to restoring any services, from rebooting the system to contacting engineering teams on the ground for advice.<br />
<br />
While we implement measures to minimise mishaps, we can't always resolve the issue before landing. When this happens, our cabin crew will usually distribute newspapers and other reading material.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If offering goodwill gesture due to tier of Frequent Flyer:-</strong></em><br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’ve credited {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If not a Frequent Flyer:-</strong></em><br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’d like to arrange a credit of {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to you.<br />
Please can you let me know your Frequent Flyer number by replying to this email so I can credit points to your account. If you’re not already a member you can use this <a href="https://www.qantas.com/en-au/frequent-flyer/join/code/familyfree">link</a> to join free of charge.<br />
<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I’d like to assure you that your comments have been passed onto our engineering management for review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
</html>